Firstline is an independent prototype. It is not the OneAquaHealth Decision Support System and is not endorsed
by the OneAquaHealth consortium.

It encodes content from these CC-BY 4.0 deliverables of the OneAquaHealth project (Horizon Europe, GA 101086521):

- D2.4 Catalogue of measures for urban aquatic ecosystems rehabilitation. Dias, Serra, Feio. 22 Dec 2025.
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20040211
- OneAquaHealth Key Indicators of Ecosystem and Biological Health (Factsheets). Schmeller et al. 22 May 2026.
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20345207
- OneAquaHealth Field Sampling Protocols for Urban Stream Ecosystems. Calapez et al. 22 May 2026.
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20344421

Quotations are verbatim, carry the printed D2.4 page number, and are checked by scripts/verify-d24-cites.mjs.
